# Cloudflare Workers static-assets _redirects.
#
# NOTE: Unlike Cloudflare Pages, the Workers static-assets runtime only allows
# RELATIVE (path-only) redirects here. Host-to-host redirects (e.g. forcing the
# bare domain to www) are NOT permitted in this file on Workers and will fail the
# build with: "Only relative URLs are allowed [code: 100324]".
#
# The bare-domain -> www canonicalization is instead handled by a Cloudflare
# Redirect Rule in the dashboard (Rules -> Redirect Rules). The canonical host is
# also declared via <link rel="canonical"> in index.html.
#
# Add any path-only redirects below, e.g.:
#   /old-page /new-page 301
